  "body": "In an elevated position at the end of a quiet driveway, this home offers rare privacy while still being moments from everything Browns Bay has to offer. It’s calm, it’s cosy, and it’s beautifully upgraded — a place where birdsong and garden views greet you every day.\r\n\r\nKey Features - Main Home:\r\n• Immaculate condition with extensive renovations\r\n• Three bedrooms upstairs including a master with ensuite\r\n• Warm living room with a lovely fireplace\r\n• Open-plan kitchen & dining with great flow\r\n• Study/home office for flexible living\r\n\r\nBonus Self-Contained Area with wide views\r\n\r\nClose the hallway door and you instantly create a private separate wing — perfect for extended family, teens, flatmates, or Airbnb income. This area includes:\r\n• Two bedrooms\r\n• Generous living space\r\n• Kitchenette\r\n• Indoor/outdoor flow to a compact deck\r\n\r\nOutdoor Living:\r\nThe 704m² (approx.) section is designed for low maintenance and maximum relaxation. The home enjoys extra privacy thanks to the neighbouring reserve — quiet, safe, and ideal for unwinding.\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n• Easy access to motorway on-ramps, transport links, shops, malls, and university\r\n• Zoned for top schools including Rangitoto College\r\n• Only five minutes’ drive to the beach and Browns Bay village\r\n\r\nMotivated Vendors:\r\n• The owners have made the decision to sell. \r\n• This is your chance to secure a peaceful, versatile home in a premium location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing — opportunities like this don’t wait.",
